{"synopsis":"Suatu hari, menara-menara hitam misterius tiba-tiba muncul di seluruh dunia, dan beberapa orang terpilih mulai terbangun.\n\nNamun bagi Bong Ju-Hyuk—seorang pria lemah dan sial yang tak berarti apa-apa—hal itu seharusnya tidak ada hubungannya dengannya.\n\nSetelah hari yang melelahkan di pekerjaan paruh waktunya, dia hampir saja menggigit mie ramen ketika—\n\n\\[Tuan Bong Ju-Hyuk, Telah Awakening.]\n\n“…Eh, sial, apa ini?!”\n\nApakah ini akhirnya kesempatan baginya untuk mengubah hidupnya?","alternative_title":"하남자의 탑 공략법","author":"Kuchikuchi, Pyopyo","artist":"Plan A","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"79723d2a-4e6c-4e73-a71d-7bc74b4ad287","number":"40","chapter":"40","title":"","date":"2026-08-02","released":"2026-08-02"},{"chapter_id":"385e07b4-acc6-43ba-ae9c-e8cda2ae3036","number":"39","chapter":"39","title":"","date":"2026-07-26","released":"2026-07-26"},{"chapter_id":"230e0c7f-f2cc-47d5-8ee5-8a0a65eb9741","number":"38","chapter":"38","title":"","date":"2026-07-19","released":"2026-07-19"},{"chapter_id":"c6117169-680a-4027-89f7-1d978a3c1ba3","number":"37","chapter":"37","title":"","date":"2026-07-13","released":"2026-07-13"},{"chapter_id":"6d937ed1-a549-4698-a691-a8b8670943e5","number":"36","chapter":"36","title":"","date":"2026-07-05","released":"2026-07-05"},{"chapter_id":"9cca2463-e1db-45bc-b00b-e04f2ffdf059","number":"35","chapter":"35","title":"","date":"2026-06-29","released":"2026-06-29"},{"chapter_id":"5e0ac7e7-f8c7-4437-9e30-b5c278e51658","number":"34","chapter":"34","title":"","date":"2026-06-29","released":"2026-06-29"},{"chapter_id":"d6ce3ced-af3c-46b5-8eb1-437b0c354f54","number":"33","chapter":"33","title":"","date":"2026-06-29","released":"2026-06-29"},{"chapter_id":"0616ce3c-f070-43e4-bb28-47374bfd2963","number":"32","chapter":"32","title":"","date":"2026-06-27","released":"2026-06-27"},{"chapter_id":"9a630a54-f160-445f-a250-ac10e0ef7df8","number":"31","chapter":"31","title":"","date":"2026-06-26","released":"2026-06-26"},{"chapter_id":"6db